kgJ_JPEG/1666270473065.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20221020_86/1666270522297i5WUL_JPEG/1666270500437.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20221020_247/1666270638714yWTje_JPEG/1666270524434.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20221020_3/1666270709015dPGmg_JPEG/1666270643357.jpg"]},{"r":5,"d":"2022-10-20","a":"1974****","t":"코튼 구매하고 맘에 들어 우드도 구매했어요.\n얼른 열심히 읽고 가득 채우고 싶네요","h":0,"b":true,"s":"5482012680","p":["https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20221020_100/1666272623570qHUDS_JPEG/1666272605259.jpg","https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20221020_206/1666272648410wiQUp_JPEG/1666272629666.jpg"]},{"r":4,"d":"2022-10-09","a":"nj****","t":"동생이 책읽는다고 사달라해서 사줬는데 너무 좋아하네요","h":0,"b":false,"s":"5482012680"},{"r":4,"d":"2022-10-05","a":"bsan***","t":"막상 샀는데 표시하기가 애매하네요..","h":0,"b":false,"s":"5482012680","p":["https://phinf.pstatic.net/checkout.phinf/20221005_136/1664941201004FDy88_JPEG/KakaoTalk_20221005_123938069.jpg"]},{"r":5,"d":"2022-10-05","a":"dlru*******","t":"태블릿으로 몇번 쓰다가 도저히 손에 안 잡혀서 독서기록 하는거 포기했는데 마음먹고 마련했어요~~~","h":0,"b":false,"s":"5482012680"}]